<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>KAZI House Design & Contracting (KHDC) | Abu Dhabi</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@500;750&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --gold: #d4af37;
            --gold-light: #f3e5ab;
            --dark: #121212;
            --dark-card: #1c1c1c;
            --text-gray: #b0b0b0;
            --white: #ffffff;
        }
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; scroll-behavior: smooth; }
        body { background-color: var(--dark); color: var(--white); overflow-x: hidden; }
        
        /* Header */
        header { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; z-index: 1000; background: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 20px 50px; }
        .logo { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 2px; }
        nav a { color: var(--white); text-decoration: none; margin-left: 30px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; transition: color 0.3s; }
        nav a:hover { color: var(--gold); }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero { height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(rgba(18,18,18,0.75), rgba(18,18,18,0.92)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80') no-repeat center center/cover; padding: 0 20px; }
        .hero h1 { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 42px; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
        .hero p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-gray); margin-bottom: 30px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 30px; background: var(--gold); color: var(--dark); font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; transition: 0.3s; }
        .btn:hover { background: var(--gold-light); transform: translateY(-2px); }

        /* Sections */
        section { padding: 90px 40px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .section-title { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 32px; color: var(--gold); text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px; position: relative; }
        .section-title::after { content: ''; width: 60px; height: 2px; background: var(--gold); display: block; margin: 10px auto 0; }

        /* Profile & About */
        .profile-card { background: var(--dark-card); border: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.3); border-radius: 8px; padding: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 40px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
        .profile-info h3 { font-size: 26px; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 5px; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; }
        .profile-info h4 { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-gray); margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .profile-info p { font-size: 15px; color: #ddd; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .badge { display: inline-block; background: rgba(212,175,55,0.1); color: var(--gold); border: 1px solid var(--gold); padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 15px; }

        /* Services Grid */
        .services-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; }
        .service-box { background: var(--dark-card); padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 3px solid var(--gold); transition: 0.3s; }
        .service-box:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); }
        .service-box i { font-size: 32px; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .service-box h3 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; }
        .service-box p { color: var(--text-gray); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }

        /* Contact Section */
        .contact-box { background: var(--dark-card); padding: 50px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.3); text-align: center; }
        .contact-info { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 30px; margin-top: 30px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .contact-item { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-gray); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
        .contact-item i { color: var(--gold); }
        .contact-item a { color: var(--text-gray); text-decoration: none; transition: 0.3s; }
        .contact-item a:hover { color: var(--gold); }

        /* Footer */
        footer { text-align: center; padding: 30px; background: #0a0a0a; border-top: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.1); color: var(--text-gray); font-size: 14px; }

        @media(max-width: 768px) {
            header { padding: 15px 20px; }
            nav { display: none; }
            .profile-card { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
            section { padding: 60px 20px; }
            .hero h1 { font-size: 32px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">KHDC</div>
        <nav>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#services">Services</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="hero">
        <div>
            <h1>KAZI House Design & Contracting</h1>
            <p>Excellence in Structural Engineering & Contracting</p>
            <a href="#contact" class="btn">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section id="about">
        <h2 class="section-title">Leadership & Profile</h2>
        <div class="profile-card">
            <div class="profile-info">
                <span class="badge">Abu Dhabi, UAE</span>
                <h3>Engr. Kazi Faiz Ahmed</h3>
                <h4>Founder & Structural Engineer</h4>
                <p>Specializing in advanced structural engineering, architectural planning, and premium contracting services. Delivering high-precision structural analysis and modern building execution aligned with international standards.</p>
                <div class="contact-item" style="justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 15px;">
                    <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> <a href="mailto:Engr.kazi_faiz@khdc.io">Engr.kazi_faiz@khdc.io</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="services">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Expertise</h2>
        <div class="services-grid">
