                <p>Precise 2D/3D floor planning, space optimization, and aesthetic structural detailing utilizing advanced engineering software.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="service-box">
                <i class="fas fa-hard-hat"></i>
                <h3>Contracting & Execution</h3>
                <p>End-to-end project management and supervision, ensuring top-tier material execution and structural integrity.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
        <h2 class="section-title">Contact Us</h2>
        <div class="contact-box">
            <p style="color: var(--text-gray); font-size: 15px;">Ready to consult on your next engineering or construction project? Connect with us directly.</p>
            <div class="contact-info">
                <div class="contact-item">
                    <i class="fas fa-phone-alt"></i> <a href="tel:+971527857861">+971 527 8578 61</a>
                </div>
                <div class="contact-item">
                    <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> <a href="mailto:Engr.kazi_faiz@khdc.io">Engr.kazi_faiz@khdc.io</a>
                </div>
                <div class="contact-item">
                    <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i> Abu Dhabi, UAE
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 KAZI House Design & Contracting (KHDC). All Rights Reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
